      "created_at": "2014-02-18T20:07:47.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So, most of the new additional rules for Vengeance boil down to \"things that affect a villain only affect one of them.\"&nbsp; However, Legacy's card Take Down says \"Villain cards cannot be played.\"</p><p>As currently phrased, that shuts down the entire Vengeful Five cycle. Is that the intended interaction, or is it intended to stop just one of them?</p>",
